<Placemark><name>Lunch: Hero's Welcome General Store</name><description>Mile 27.6. 3537 US Route 2, North Hero, VT. (802) 372-4161. Deli, bakery and general store on the lake. Standard hours Mon to Sat 7 to 6, Sun 8 to 5; hours are reduced seasonally.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.29068,44.81642</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: Quality Hotel Centre de Congrès</name><description>Mile 72.8. 725 Boul. du Séminaire N, Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu, QC. +1 (450) 300-5177. North side of town, near the canal. Choice Hotels toll-free: 1-800-667-3815.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.26641,45.32482</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hotel: Auberge Harris</name><description>Mile 72.5. 576 Rue Champlain, Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu, QC. +1 (450) 348-3821. Riverside inn close to the start of the canal path. Toll-free 1-800-668-3821.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.26475,45.32391</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bike: Cycle LM</name><description>Mile 72.8, 2.4 mi off route. 270 Boul. Saint-Luc, Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu, QC. . Bike shop with a repair workshop, about 2.4 mi west of the route. Replaces 'Performance Bégin', which could not be found. Phone not verified: see cyclelm.com.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.29597,45.35408</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>BORDER: Rouses Point–Lacolle 223</name><description>Mile 47.5. Open 8 AM to 8 PM daily (both sides). Passport, EDL or NEXUS. No cannabis.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.37086,45.01030</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Station: Rouses Point</name><description>Mile 46.4, 0.3 mi off route.</description><Point><coordinates>-73.37117,44.99500</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
